window.products.push({"id":1125059,"name":"Travel Life Starry Night Map World Edition Scratch World Map & World Map","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EzlOz1k8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description: To experience your stunning beauty, I have been marching forward day and night. When dusk falls upon the earth, I sharpen my eyes, and find that your beauty is so pure under the serene night sky. TheTravel Life Starry Night Map (World Edition) allows you to enjoy the clear breathtaking views upon the planet earth from a perspective of 30,000 feet above. In the dark night, the shiny city names resemble stars, just like night view of a city when the evening lights are lit. The world's official languages currently in use express the spirits of the nations. Instructions for Use： The colorful world awaits you to explore it. For each country, its name and unique tourist attractions are concealed beneath the silver scratch coating. After you have visited one spot, you may scratch the coating off the location on the map. It just feels like that you are exploring and creating your exclusive new world like Columbus' expedition to the New Continent. Wanna cross the Sahara Desert? Wanna fly over the Bermuda Triangle? Or swim across the Atlantic? It's all up to you! Use sticker paper to mark your most unforgettable journeys! In each journey, there must be something unforgettable for you, be it food, scenery, or music, or even a romantic rendezvous! Here you record them, and make them your eternal memories!Features&details: Material: Both-side coated art paper Dimension: H 782mm D83mm Weight: 933g Content: Starlight Map(1056mm X 750mm) Notice: 1.Please allow 1-3mm error due to manual measurement. Please make sure you do not mind before you bid. 2.The colors may have difference as the different display,please understand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EzlOz1k8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D&Y","source_asin":"B01FFRCQ2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FFRCQ2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FFRCQ2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1125060,"name":"Electric Can Opener, 2AA Batteries Operated Smooth Soft Edge with One-Touch Start Automatic Can Opener for Arthritis Individuals, Seniors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LXFF8aEML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"1: Recessed blade This automatic can opener features a sharp blade that is safely recessed within the unit. This safety feature helps prevent accidental cuts to your fingers when searching for the tool in your kitchen drawers. 2: Metal gear Using a can opener couldn’t be simpler with the straightforward design of the Automatic Can Opener. To open a can, position the rim of the can in between the blade and the metal gear. The metal gear guides the rim of the can through the can opener so it moves in a full 360° circle by itself. 3: Battery compartment The new can opener is completely different from the original design in appearance. Moreover, it is designed with a plastic sheet in the battery cartridge, which further stabilizes the batteries installed. 4: On/off switch The simple one-touch button couldn’t be easier to operate. Simply press down to begin cutting the can, then press again at any time to stop the action. 5: Magnet When you lift the can opener off the can, the magnet on the Automatic Can Opener will also pick up the lid. There’s no need to fish into the can with your fingers! It is more hygienic and safe than traditional can openers because the strong magnet does all the work. 6: Insert 2AA batteries in the right poles The battery groove is marked with signs of positive and negative electrodes respectively. While installing the four dry batteries, users should do as indicated by the signs. Once installation is done, cover the battery and the product is ready for use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LXFF8aEML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"instecho","source_asin":"B07GV5LFL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GV5LFL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GV5LFL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
