window.products.push({"id":1125067,"name":"LED Display Food Digital Kitchen Scale Stainless Steel Platform Weight Ounce Pound Gram for Cooking Baking with Tare (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XccgTK3OL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"When Coronavirus or Flu virus is spreading,you can enjoy every day with your families by baking,cooking,hop pot and so on.The family-days will be peaceful and safe.Hope your isolated/single days BRING the world strong and healthy.Use this type kitchen scale to make your baking ,cooking easier! This digital scale has endless uses for personal or commercial environments - great for homes, kitchens, offices, and more. The scale has an easy-to-read LED display with beautiful clear backlit. With a capacity of 11lb (5kg), you can weigh a variety of items with ease. You will be surprised at all the uses you will have for this product. Weighing Functions You can easily choose among measurement in oz, lb:oz, g, ml (Milk & Water). This digital scale measures in precise increments of 0.04oz (1 g) to accurately weigh your items. Power is provided by 3 AAA batteries (included), making the scale portable and ensuring that you can easily acquire replacement batteries. Tare Function The tare function allows the user to deduct the weight of a container from the total weight in order to determine the net weight of the contents excluding the weight of the container which holds them. Clear Display and Auto-off The scale has an easy-to-read backlit display, staying 30 seconds for easily reading. To save energy, the scale also features an auto-off function, allowing the scale to turn off after 2 minutes inactivity. Do not mix new and used batteries to power the device. Specifications: *Weight Capacity: 176oz / 5000g / 11 lbs *Units: g / oz / lb/oz /ml (Baking,Milk & Water) *Measurement Increments: 0.04 oz / 1 g *Minimum Measurement: 1g-5g *Auto-Off: 2 Minutes *Power: 3 x AAA 1.5V DC *Dimensions: 5.7 x 7.9 x 0.7 inches  Package Contents: *1 x Digital Kitchen Scale *1 x User Manual *3 x AAA DC batteries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XccgTK3OL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uncleahtoh","source_asin":"B0824MNX4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0824MNX4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0824MNX4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
