window.products.push({"id":1125244,"name":"Dimayar Bento Lunch Box 3 Pieces 1 Insulated Lunch Bag Lunch Bags for Women Insulated Lunch Bag Full Zipper Closure Lunch Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GxaMWkP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand: Dimayar Dimensions: 17\" x 10\" x 5\" Materials outside polyester,inside thick form insulation What you will get? 1 insulated lunch bag,3 pieces of bento box The dimayar Lunch Bag Set is full of convenient features that will make it easy to enjoy a fresh and healthy meal anywhere! The lunch box is made of high quality polyester with extra thick PEVA-lined insulation. Dual carry straps make the bag easy to tote and side pocket conveniently holds All components are completely nontoxic, food safe, and BPA-free. Set includes: (1) insulated zipper lunch bag with dual carry straps & side pocket, (3) bento lunch box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GxaMWkP7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dimayar","source_asin":"B07W6F9NML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W6F9NML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W6F9NML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1125245,"name":"Pixy Family Hanging Mobile - 11 Inches - High Quality - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717aA33vp2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile?Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent.How long can my Mobile last?One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years.Can my mobile hang outdoors?No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable.Will my mobile fade?In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight.When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions:1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717aA33vp2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B0033S8LR0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0033S8LR0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0033S8LR0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
