window.products.push({"id":1125363,"name":"Thanksgiving Candle Holders Table Decorations 4 Pack Mr and Mrs Pilgrim Harvest Resin Taper Candles Holder for Autumn Centerpiece Home Kitchen Dining ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OzoRJj+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enhance your dinner table with this set of 4 Thanksgiving taper candle holders. The candle centerpieces comes in 2 designs and you get 2 of each: Mr or boy pilgrim wearing a black pilgrim hat, blonde hair, black top and pants, white collar, brown belt, white socks, brown shoes holding a yellow basket with fruit inside. Mrs. or girl pilgrim wearing a white bonnet, brown hair, brown dress, white collar, blue shoes, holding a tray with turkey. These candlesticks can be used as decorative holder for your candles. You can also give them as gifts to family and friends. These fall candle holders are ideal as your candlestick base, around a taper candle or a column of candles to add to the traditional colors of the season. Use with Drip less taper candles or Led taper candles. Arrange with your favorite candles or napkins on a dining or console table for a simple, yet festive centerpiece. Made of high quality painted resin material with a metal insert on top for the candle. These harvest centerpieces can be added to your candle holder base, around your taper candle sticks for adding extra color and texture. They will be the perfect accent to your Thanksgiving floral creations, farmhouse weddings, autumn table centerpieces and more! Whether your taste is modern, rustic or country, these candle holders will add just the right holiday touch to your home. Dimensions: 4.25 inch Height, base is 2.25 inch Diameter and top is 1\" diameter to fit easily around a standard taper candle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OzoRJj+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Boutique","source_asin":"B0B75RNQNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B75RNQNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B75RNQNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
