window.products.push({"id":1125368,"name":"Sunset Trading Oak Selections Kitchen Island Set, Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":959.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rg0ZFKz1L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enhance the beauty and warmth of your kitchen while extending your work surface, dining and storage space with this finely hand crafted drop leaf island set that matches with any Sunset Trading Oak selections dining piece. This transitional seating is perfect for preparing family meals or serving drinks and appetizers when entertaining guests. The drop leaf instantly converts this Island into a breakfast bar perfect for quick meals or casual entertaining, accommodating two barstools when open. Paired with coordinating bar stools, This classic drop leaf bar set will be sure to complement your kitchen decor and provide a welcome gathering place for your family and friends for years to come!features & benefits>- set includes island and two counter stools>- handy drop leaf instantly converts island console into a bar or extra dining space when guests arrive>- handcrafted solid wood and wood veneer kitchen island with decorative accents>- Two doors open to one adjustable shelf with three Shelf height options for convenient storage of pots, liquor bottles or other large items>- sturdy 1\" Thick top- ample space for barstools when 10\" Leaf is Up- leg clearance: 35\"- protectors on feet to keep your flooring safe>- two drawers with metal Euro Glides for storing utensils, bar or kitchen essentialsisland Dimensions and weight:- overall: 36\"H x 21.75\"D x 42\"w- island base: 35\"H x 18.75\"D x 34\"w- island using 10\" Leaf: 36\"H x 31.5\"D x 42\"w- cabinet interior: 23.5 h x 14.25 D x 30 w- drawer Dimensions (2): 2.25\"H x 13\"D x 10.5\"W- side overhangs: 5.25\" - front overhang: 3\"- non-removable feet (4): 4 h x 2.5 dia - Weight: 115 lbs.barstool features:- two traditional Windsor style cafe Height stools>- contoured back for added comfortable>- scooped swivel seat>- Factory tested to support up to 350 lbs.- commercial grade steel leg braces>- steel reinforced turned legs for heavy duty supportstool Dimensions and weight:- overall: 40\"H x 18.5\"D x 21\"w- seat: 24\"H x 17\"D x 18.5\"W- seat back: 21.75\"H>- Seat to top of bottom footrest: 17.5\"H>- Weight (2): 24 lbs.studio photography lighting, slight Measurement and weight variances are possible. Your viewing device may display colors differently than in real life>- decorative items in photo not includedcare: clean with light furniture polish, wipe with dry, lint-free cloth>- simple assembly required>- Two year warranty against manufacturer defects>- free wood samples available!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rg0ZFKz1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunset Trading","source_asin":"B07KMVT28B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KMVT28B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KMVT28B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
