window.products.push({"id":1125617,"name":"A Cheerful Giver - Crumb Coffee Cake Mama Scented Glass Jar Candle (22oz) with Lid & True to Life Fragrance Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XX9WuezVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let this scented jar candle's smell of warm, golden coffee cake with a sweet layer of cinnamon sugar butter crumb lift your mood. Enjoy 125 hours of burn time from this lovely candle made with a lead-free wick and infused with a long-lasting fragrance. This glass jar candle with a black lid and lovely homespun ribbon looks great in any room and makes your home or office smell amazing for hours. As part of the Keepers of the Light Collection, this wonderful home decor candle is a great housewarming gift or perfect for any occasion. This 22 oz. scented candle measures 4.25\" diameter x 3.75\" H, comes complete with a Keepers of the Light tag, and is proudly made in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XX9WuezVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Cheerful Giver","source_asin":"B072FQZBPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072FQZBPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072FQZBPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1125618,"name":"Wedgwood Cornucopia 5-Piece Dinnerware Place Setting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":258.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D6ncZvVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Cornucopia pattern by Wedgwood displays wide bands of ivory parchment and ribbons of dark navy with roped ochre accents. The salad/dessert plate hosts a mythical whirl of unicorns, satyrs and horns in a wide cobalt border. Rimmed in 22-karat gold. Cornucopia is dishwasher safe with recommended detergents. Amazon.com Richly decorative, Wedgwood's Cornucopia dinnerware makes a striking statement at formal dining occasions. Combining opulent tones and mythical imagery, it has a highly distinctive look that is perfect for special occasions. Starting with a base of pure white bone china, the pattern features broad borders of flecked parchment tones. Narrow bands of ochre and dark blue define the edges, and a rope-style border adds dimension and detail. A single elegant cornucopia motif and generous 22-karat gold banding at the rims create a note of sophistication and polish. This salad plate in this place setting for one features a lovely variation in the pattern. Its widest band is dark blue and set with finely detailed images of satyrs, unicorns, fish, fawns, and monkeys amid elaborate scrollwork. This contrast is especially handsome when the plates are stacked for multiple courses. Five pieces in all, the set includes a 10-3/4-inch dinner plate, an 8-inch salad/dessert plate, a 6-inch bread and butter plate, a 5-3/4-inch saucer, and a footed teacup. All pieces are dishwasher-safe with recommended detergents, and Cornucopia is also available in serving pieces and accessories. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting includes: 10-3/4-inch dinner plate; 8-inch salad/dessert plate; 6-inch bread and butter plate; 5-3/4-inch saucer; teacup. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D6ncZvVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wedgwood","source_asin":"B015HJKTC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015HJKTC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015HJKTC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
