window.products.push({"id":1125634,"name":"TechCraft CRE60B 60-Inch Wide Flat Panel TV Credenza - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TNOGAroSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description 60 Inches Wide Black Credenza fits most 60 Inches and Smaller Flat Panels From the Manufacturer The Techcraft CRE60B TV Stand is a 60\"-wide stand, with solid wood construction, that accommodates most 65\" and smaller flat-panel HDTVs. Framed glass doors open to give access to three compartments with adjustable shelves for your TV and audio-video components, and the spacious design allows plenty of air flow for your electronics. Real wood construction, beautiful framed doors, and plenty of space for your components Fits 65\" and Smaller HDTVs The CRE60B stand features beautiful framed glass doors, with solid wood construction and a black veneer finish, to hold your flat-panel display and matching components such as DVD players, Blu-ray players, home theater receivers, gaming consoles, and more. There's ample space for your audio-video components, with three compartments with adjustable shelves. The center console is 14\" wide and is perfect for a center-channel speaker, as well as other small components. The outer cabinets are 16 7/8\" wide for your home theater components. The top shelf holds HDTVs weighing up to 175 pounds, and each of the lower shelves holds components up to 33 pounds. Spacious shelf design means there's plenty of space for heat dissipation, leaving your electronics cool and running at top efficiency. Cord Management Made Easy This stand features easy and convenient cable management. Six holes are pre-cut into the back of the stand--one for each shelf--to pass cords through, as well as a separate cut-out in the top center shelf to run wiring for a center-channel speaker. So even with the open shelf layout, you can still hide unsightly cables and keep your components organized. Sleek and Modern Design The elegant, classic design of the CRE60B is built to match nearly any home decor. The credenza styling of the shelves make it suitable for placement in any room. The stand is made from real, solid wood with a black veneer finish. Metal braces add sturdiness and durability to the frame for a long life of use. The framed glass doors are clear to be able to see your components' displays, as well as adding a classic touch to the overall style, and are easy to clean. About Techcraft For the people at Techcraft, these words signify the main goal: to provide furniture solutions for consumers of today's high-tech audio and video components. The home theater revolution has brought the cinema into the home and made home entertainment simpler, but the consumer electronics components themselves are more complicated. Techcraft's goal is to provide furniture which can simplify and organize the hardware, software, and wiring for even the most demanding home theater setups. At the same time, Techcraft continues striving to build great designs, with great quality, ease of assembly, and exceptional follow-up service. Technical Specifications Flat-Panel Sizes Supported: Up to 65\" Flat-Panel Sizes Supported: Up to 65\" Shelving System: 6 x adjustable shelves Shelving System: 6 x adjustable shelves Top Shelf Capacity: 175 lbs. (79kg) Top Shelf Capacity: 175 lbs. (79kg) Component Shelf Capacity: 33 lbs. (15kg) Component Shelf Capacity: 33 lbs. (15kg) Dimensions: 22 3/8\" x 59 7/8\" x 19 3/4\" (568mm x 1521mm x 502mm) Dimensions: 22 3/8\" x 59 7/8\" x 19 3/4\" (568mm x 1521mm x 502mm) Weight: 111 lbs. (50kg) Weight: 111 lbs. (50kg)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TNOGAroSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techcraft","source_asin":"B00BN36Q10","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BN36Q10","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BN36Q10","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
