window.products.push({"id":1125691,"name":"Seasonal Sensations Bubble Column Fountain 7-Color bright Light Changing LED Lamp, Bubbling Water Aqua Tower, 7 by 4-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911tYYLJzcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Very Bright, Relaxing, Soothing, and Fun. Use for sensory lighting, Parties, Kids Rooms etc. Adults and Kids alike are sure to love this. This a 7 Foot tall 4 inch diameter water column. This is the highest of LED quality and sure to delight! Why LED's? They are cool to touch, brighter, last longer, and change colors without a moving motor (other columns use Hot halogen bulbs that burn out and fade the colors of a motor color gel). Included is a 14\"X14\" base, low voltage LED lights, a bubble pump, and a cool to touch Acrylic tube. 40 Bright L.E.D lights make up 7 Different Colors (Red, Green, Blue, White, Lime, Purple, and Teal). Chose your settings on solid (one color) or watch as the seven colors automatically rotate. With the touch of a switch you can also adjust the flow of bubbles. The Bright L.E.D's illuminate from the base of this Bubble Column. Easy to set up with NO TOOLS NECESSARY. All you have to do is add water! Easy take town with a no lifting drain system allows you to drain the water out from the base. Watch and relax as your worries will flow away with bubbles! Find thousands of applications and be creative with your own decorating techniques (try clumping more than one column together or use different decorations to add flavor to your column). Clear Cap Included. Must add your own water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911tYYLJzcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seasonal Sensations.","source_asin":"B00II8QX3O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00II8QX3O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00II8QX3O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
