window.products.push({"id":1125696,"name":"Premium Beeswax Food Wraps - Extra Large 4 Pack Including Beeswax Pellets - 1 Large, 1 Medium, 2 Small Wraps - 100% Natural, Biodegradable and Organic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ob6-kuebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ NATURAL PRODUCT - These organic food wraps are crafted of cotton cloth, dipped in a special mix of beeswax, jojoba oil and tree resin. All the materials are 100% natural, biodegradable and compostable, ensuring zero waste or pollution. An eco-friendly alternative to plastic and the perfect way to store and protect your food, snacks, veggies, and fruits without harming the environment. ✅ WIDE APPLICATION - Use this beeswax wrap set to safely store vegetables, fruits, bread in the fridge, to cover bowls, containers, cups, etc. or for packing snacks, cheese or sandwiches for lunch, camping trips or picnics. ✅ LARGE SET - The beeswax wraps are flexible enough and come in a convenient set of 4 wraps: 1 Large (13 x 14 inch), 1 Medium (10 x 11 inch), and 2 Small Wraps (7 x 8 inch) to meet your various wrapping needs. As a little EXTRA for you, we have added beeswax pellets to your set, to extend the lifetime of your wraps. ✅ REUSABLE & SUSTAINABLE - With proper care, these multipurpose food wraps can last multiple uses, saving you money and eliminating waste. The natural ingredients beeswax, jojoba oil and tree resin help to keep food fresh and allow the Wraps to be used over again. To clean, hand wash your wraps in cold water with mild soap, air dry them to be ready for the next use. ✅ EASY TO USE - When using the beeswax wraps for the first time, warm them up with the body temperature of your hands to make them soft and malleable. Use the pressure of your hands to create a tight seal on bowls, cups, containers, foods or snacks and keep them fresh to maximize their lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ob6-kuebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Promora","source_asin":"B07VNV65T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VNV65T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VNV65T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1125697,"name":"COZUMO Toddler Hooded Beach Bath Towel Wrap – Baby Shark Soft Beach Towel Swim Pool Coverup Poncho Cape for Boys Kids Children Gift, 1-7 Years Old Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q61YFnK3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"☛ WHY DO YOU CHOOSE OUR MICROFIBER TOWELS? ➢ Our beach towel is made of SGS certified microfiber material,colour fastness level 4,no smell. They are truly healthy and recyclable. Different from others,it would be safe for children and adults.➢Measure 34.5”*23’' ,these kids’ bath towels are large enough for ages under 7 years use.➢ The vibrant colors didn’t fade or bleed when it got wet.You can aslo use it as a blanket for comfort and warmth on an airplane or on your sofa. ➢We use high-quality absorbent fabrics for the two printed sides.Therefore these towels is not only softer than the ordinary 100% microfiber towel, but also can absorbs almost 1-2 times more water than other microfiber towels. ➢Multi-purpose micro fiber towel is a perfect Gift for any summer occasion. Great for your vacations, reunions, pool parties, and countless other events! Beach towel is also perfect to use as a bath towel, beach wrap, sun cape,bathing suit cover, or sarong. Get ready for some fun in the sun with the printed beach towel! ➢Our Advantages: ◇100% Microfiber◇Ultra absorbant and quick dry◇Sand free◇Compact with a carry pouch◇With a handy hook and dry easily and quickly◇Machine wash is OK◇Easycare ◇Eco Friendly,no deformation to human beings◇Stylish designs and no fade ☛ Take Care Tips: ◇Soak in warm water before use, not suitable to soak in hot water.◇Simply machine wash in cold water on the delicate cycle without blench. ◇Do not iron or dry clean. ◇Tumble dry on low. ◇Towels should not be used for more than six months. ☛ To Customers: We hope to provide customers with more unique,high-quality products and better service.If you have any question or suggestion about our products,please kindly contact us by Amazon shop email. May you love it and enjoy your nice day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q61YFnK3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZUMO","source_asin":"B07RQPCR1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQPCR1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQPCR1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
