window.products.push({"id":1125728,"name":"URBANE O2 Insulated Water Bottle,Leakproof 18/8 Stainless Steel Insulated Mug Keep Coffee Hot or Cold for hours，17 Ounce(Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nEg3COQjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"URBANE - O2 mug is designed for love in life. This insulated mug enables you to get through a day in the office, intense workout or afternoon tea with free and easy. WHY URBANE - O2  URBANE - O2 Stainless Steel 17oz. Thermos Water Bottle has a vacuum insulation that keeps beverages hot or cold for hours. Durable and sanitary 18/8 stainless steel, BPA and phthalate free making a healthy choice when you drink from a URBANE - O2. Perfect BPA-free leak-proof lid which resists staining and provides durability prevent the lid from leaking or sweating. And because of the double wall insulation, the stainless steel body stays cool to the touch with hot beverages and condensation-free with cold beverages. Features and Benefits Constructed with double wall stainless steel, this 17 ounce tumbler is sturdy, yet its sleek design is both eye-catching and functional. For tea drinkers, a built-in tea hook is just the ticket to brew tea on the go. The tea hook can also accommodate most loose leaf infusers. Quality guarantee The cup body is made of 18/8 stainless metal, and cover made of BPA-free food grade PP, sealing ring is made of the food grade silica gel, safety and health. With the electrolysis grinding technology, makes the mug rustproof,solid and durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nEg3COQjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"URBANE O2","source_asin":"B014G4K4LA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014G4K4LA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014G4K4LA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
