window.products.push({"id":1125752,"name":"Dochee Rug Grippers, Anti Curling Non Slip Rug Pad for Hardwood Floors and Tiles Floors, Reusable Rug Tape for Area Rugs (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Feature: 1?I believe even those gorgeous decor accessories can be a cause of concern for you when they curl up in the corners not only making the rug look unsightly and sloppy but also making you trip and slip when you step on the corners. Your kids, elderly family members and pet sare especially at a greater risk of tripping. But now you can use the rug grippers and prevent all such accidents and make your rugs look neat and tidy too. 2?These 8 pieces of anti-slip rug grippers can simply be stuck to the back of a mat. Suction technology firmly sticks to the floor without causing marksor damage, and the gripper easily peels off the floor 3?The anti-slip gripper uses PU material and Non-toxic and odorless ,can prevents the carpet from curling. these 3-sided grip under rug corner pieces are shaped to fit corners more efficiently and adhere them to the surface to prevent curling, sliding, or movement. 4?The carpet gripper pad can be used perfectly in various environments, including indoor, outdoor, camping, balcony,yard and vehicles. Note: It is not recommended to use it on a carpet with a plush back or with very rough surface please, which may remove the fluff because of the strong stickiness of the carpet grippers can not develop very big function. Silicone and rubber can't be used either Moisten the rug grippers before you remove tapes from the mat. Pull very gently slowly so that your carpet and floor would not be damaged. Do not expose them to sun light foran extended period of time Do not place in the washing machine. Keep away from children and pet. Make sure the floor and carpet gripper are dry before use.Pack Included: 8 Pcs Rug Gripper","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dochee","source_asin":"B0916NTHNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0916NTHNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0916NTHNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
