window.products.push({"id":1125845,"name":"Dehumidifier 3500 Sq. Ft 50 Pint BRITSOU Dehumidifiers for Home Basements Bedroom | Quiet Dehumidifier for Medium to Large Room with Drain Hose | Dry ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aRQjMrMQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【50 Pints Dehumidifier Covers Up to 3500 Sq. Ft of Space】Birtsou 50 pint Dehumidifier is the perfect choice to maintain a healthy humidity range in large spaces up to 3500 sq. ft. It‘s ideal for use in your home, basement, bedroom, bathroom, closet, office, garage, kitchen, laundry room, storage room, and even your RV. This dehumidifier can set the humidity from 30% to 80% and can adjust to the perfect humidity level of 45-55% for you to create a comfortable home environment. 【3 Distinct Modes】All designed to help you maintain a healthy, comfortable environment. The DEHU mode is perfect for keeping your home at the optimal humidity level, ideal for spaces with a clear need for humidity. The DRY mode is ideal for drying wet clothes quickly and efficiently. It works to quickly remove moisture and dampness, leaving your clothes feeling soft and dry. The CONT mode is great for high humidity spaces, so you can stay comfortable in even the most humid of environments. 【So Comforting】Equipped with a built-in ultra-sensitive temperature humidity sensors and auto defrost, you can be sure that it’s always working efficiently and effectively. The 24H two-way timer ensures the dehumidifier is always running at the right time, and the child lock keeps your little ones away from the controls. The noise level is as low as 40dB, so you don’t have to worry about any loud noises disrupting your home, and also comes with overheat protection for added safety. 【Ingenuity Appearance Design】Complete with ergonomic recessed handle, four 360° invisible wheels make it easy to move and its compact size allows you to store it away when not in use. The front water level line allows you to easily monitor the water levels in the tank, while the digital humidity display keeps you informed of the ideal humidity levels for your space. The removable and re-washable air filter ensures that you always keep the air in your home clean and fresh. 【Auto Drainage】We provide an additional 3.28 feet (1m) of drain hose, simply connect it to the outlet and remove the water plug for continuous drainage without having to manually empty the tank. This hassle-free feature makes it easy to keep the air in your home clear and dry all the time. 【Manual drainage】The dehumidifier is equipped with a 0.66-gallon (2.5L) water tank that sets the ideal humidity level and keeps it running continuously. It features an auto-stop function when the tank is full, so you won't have to worry about it overflowing. Plus, it has a full water indicator to remind you to empty the tank when it's full. Simply plug it in, set the desired humidity level, and you're good to go. 【Excellent Customer Support】Are you looking for a reliable and effective dehumidifier to help you keep your home free from excess moisture? The Britsou Home Dehumidifier is not just powerful and efficient, it also provides superior customer support, if you have any questions about our products, our friendly customer service team is available 24/7 to provide you with the answers you need. 【Warranty Guarantee】Britsou dehumidifiers is made of high-quality materials and is designed to be energy efficient, so you can be sure you'll get the most out of it. Two-year warranty, free replacement, and lifetime technical support, you can be sure that your dehumidifier will keep working for a long time. Britsou is the perfect choice for anyone looking for an effective, reliable and efficient dehumidifier. Get your dehumidifier today and start enjoying a healthier, fresher home environment！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aRQjMrMQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Britsou","source_asin":"B09WRM4C9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WRM4C9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WRM4C9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
