window.products.push({"id":1125953,"name":"Duoai Mini USB Handheld Fan Battery Operated, 4000mAh Hand Held Rechargeable Small Quiet Personal Fans Portable with Base 5 Speeds for Kids Women Make","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fmu2z0FcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 Speed Setting & Unique Low Battery Reminder: This powerful personal fan has 5 speed level(Low/Medium/High/Stronger/Sleep Mode). The sleep mode can avoid headaches, stuffy nose caused by prolonged strong wind. Recharge in Time: Press the power button first time to see how much power is left and whether the fan needs to be recharged. LED indicator status: 1) All 4 lights on:75%-100% power left; 2) 3 lights on: 50%-75% power left; 3) 2 lights on: 25%-50% left; 4) 1 light on: 1%-25% power left USB Powered & 4000mAh Battery Operated Fan: This portable small outdoor / indoor fan operates with a long-run durable rechargeable 4000mAh battery (lasts up to 24 hours after a full charge). It can also be powered by included 3.2ft long Micro-USB charging cable, which can link to PC / laptop/notebook, mobile power bank, 5V wall USB charger, portable charger, car charger and any other USB-enabled power supply to enjoy cool wind no matter where you go. ATTN: Needs about 5 hours to full charge Ultra-Quiet & Multifunctional Fan with Removable Fan Stand: This universal office fan uses a silent structure which is engineered to be ultra-quiet while delivering high airflow. The removable fan base makes it as a desk fan or handheld fan to carry it around on hot days. Meanwhile, the fan base can also be used as a mobile phone holder for video watching. It’s ideal for home, bedroom, desktop, dorm, study, library, games room and only stand little space. Perfect for travel and camping Portable Anti-Slip Pocket Fan: ONLY 0.48 lb! Compact lightweight design for maximum convenience to fit it easily into any backpack, handbag or laptop bag, space-saving on desk and easy to carry around with you for some cool air. BEST HELPER FOR HOT FLASHES. Good helper to dry eyelash, skin cream and spray when you need a small portable hand held fan for applying makeup Perfect Present Choice & Satisfactory Service: This usb travel fan is Life Saver in Summer to keep you cool at travelling, working or doing sports. Anyone who wants to stop sweating, whether at work or at rest, should get this small portable fan. We offer 24 months limited warranty and a Lifetime Enthusiastic After-Sale Service. If for any reason you're not happy with your purchase - please feel free to contact us via e-mail for any question, we will resolve the issue for you within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fmu2z0FcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duoai","source_asin":"B09166B3F7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1125953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09166B3F7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09166B3F7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
